        {
          "text": "Orakhaayilwa inzu yowashio ta, orakhaayilwa omukhasi wowashio ta kata omukholiwe oweshisaatsa, kata omukholiwe oweshikhasi, kata ing'ombeye, kata isishiliye, kata eshindu shiosi eshia owashio ali ninashio tawe.",
