          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abandu bosi nibalola akokhukukuma, nende tsimbenu, nende oluyoka lwolwika, nende eshikulu nishituuma omwosi; ne olwa abandu balola batechela, nibasinjila ehale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.20.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.20.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 20:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nibamusunjila Musa bari Iwe osungane nineefwe, mana khuhulile; nebutswa Nyasaye aleshe okhusungana nineefwe; khwakhafwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.20.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.20.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 20:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musa nasunjila abandu ari Muraria ta; okhuba Nyasaye yeetsile okhumuteema, khandi mbu oburiisiibwe bube mumoni tsieenywe, muleshe okhwonoonanga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.20.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.20.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
